{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31759","headline":"怀郑从志 · 贾岛","name":"怀郑从志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西风吹阴云，雨雪半夜收。\n忽忆天涯人，起看斗与牛。\n故人别二年，我意如百秋。\n音信两杳杳，谁云昔绸缪。\n平明一封书，寄向东北舟。\n翩翩春归鸟，会自爲匹俦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31759.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31759","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}